"html": "<figure><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/angel_cedazo_honorary.png\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"150\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/angel_cedazo-150x150.webp\" width=\"150\"/></a></figure><h3><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/angel_cedazo_honorary.png\"><br/>2024<br/><br/>Angel Cedazo Minguez</a></h3><p>Professor, MD, PhD</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ki.se/en/people/angel-cedazo-minguez\">Department of Neurobiology,</a><br/><a href=\"https://ki.se/en/people/angel-cedazo-minguez\">Care Sciences and Society,</a></p><p><a href=\"https://ki.se/en\">Karolinska Institute</a></p><p>Sweden</p>\n<figure><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/Honorary-Scientist_Prof.-Chririeac_nov-2023-scaled.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"150\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/Lucian-Chirieac-Honorary-Scientist-2023-150x150.jpg\" width=\"150\"/></a></figure><h3><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/Honorary-Scientist_Prof.-Chririeac_nov-2023-scaled.jpg\"> 2023   Lucian Radu Chirieac </a></h3><p>Professor, M.D. </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://connects.catalyst.harvard.edu/Profiles/display/Person/41938\">Professor of Pathology, Harvard Medical School</a></p><p>Senior Pathologist, Brigham and Women’s Hospital</p><p>Boston, MA, USA</p>\n<figure><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/HONORARY-SCIENTIST-2023_Prof-Diaz-LA.png\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"150\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/Prof.-Luis-A-Diaz-150x150.jpg\" width=\"150\"/></a></figure><h3><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/HONORARY-SCIENTIST-2023_Prof-Diaz-LA.png\"><br/>2023<br/><br/>Luis A. Diaz</a></h3><p>Professor, M.D. </p>\n<p>Head of Division of Solid Tumor Oncology; Grayer Family Chair</p><p>Professor of Medicine, Weill Cornell Medical College</p><p><b><a href=\"https://www.mskcc.org/cancer-care/doctors/luis-diaz-jr\">Memorial Sloan Kettering Cancer </a></b></p><p><b><a href=\"https://www.mskcc.org/cancer-care/doctors/luis-diaz-jr\">Center</a></b>,</p><p>New York, NY, USA</p>\n<figure><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/diploma_derek.png\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"150\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/derekhausenloy-150x150.jpg\" width=\"150\"/></a></figure><h3><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/diploma_derek.png\"><br/>2022<br/><br/>Derek J. Hausenloy</a></h3><p>Professor, MD, PhD</p>\n<p>Professor in the Cardiovascular &amp; Metabolic Disorders Signature Program</p><p><a href=\"https://www.duke-nus.edu.sg/directory/detail/derek-john-hausenloy\">Duke-NUS Medical School, Singapore</a></p><p>Senior Consultant</p><p><a href=\"https://www.nhcs.com.sg/profile/derek-hausenloy\">National Heart Centre Singapore</a></p><p>Professor of Cardiovascular Medicine</p><p><a href=\"https://iris.ucl.ac.uk/iris/browse/profile?upi=DHAUS05\">The Hatter Cardiovascular Institute, University College of London</a></p>\n<figure><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/HonoraryScientistProfVV-scaled.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"150\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/profvv-150x150.jpg\" width=\"150\"/></a></figure><h3><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/HonoraryScientistProfVV-scaled.jpg\"><br/>2021<br/><br/>Victor Velculescu</a></h3><p>Professor, MD, PhD</p>\n<p>Professor of Oncology and Pathology</p><p><a href=\"https://www.jhu-bmb-phd.org/faculty/victor-velculescu\">Johns Hopkins University School of Medicine</a></p><p>Co-Director of Cancer Genetics and Epigenetics</p><p><a href=\"https://www.hopkinsmedicine.org/profiles/details/victor-velculescu\">Johns Hopkins Kimmel Cancer Center</a></p><p>Baltimore, MD</p>\n<figure><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/DiplomaHonoraryScientistStefanN.png\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"150\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/StefanConstantinescu-150x150.png\" width=\"150\"/></a></figure><h3><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/DiplomaHonoraryScientistStefanN.png\"><br/>2020<br/><br/>Ştefan Constantinescu</a></h3><p>Professor, MD, PhD</p>\n<p>Université Catholique de Louvain</p><p><a href=\"https://www.ludwigcancerresearch.org/scientist/stefan-n-constantinescu/\">Ludwig Institute for Cancer Research</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.deduveinstitute.be/receptor-and-JAK-signaling-and-hematology\">Christian de Duve Institute of Cellular Pathology</a></p><p>Bruxelles</p><p>Belgium</p>\n<figure><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Prof-Ruedi-Aebersold.png\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"150\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/ruedi-150x150.jpg\" width=\"150\"/></a></figure><h3><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Prof-Ruedi-Aebersold.png\"><br/>2019<br/><br/>Ruedi Aebersold</a></h3><p>Professor, PhD</p>\n<p>HUPO Awards (2005),</p><p>Otto Naegeli Prize (2010),</p><p>Thomson Medal Award (2012),</p><p>Bijvoet Medal of the Bijvoet Center for Biomolecular Research of Utrecht University (2018).</p><p><a href=\"https://imsb.ethz.ch/research/aebersold/people/ruedi-aebersold.html\">Institute of Molecular Systems Biology  ETH Zurich</a></p>\n<figure><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Diploma_RudolphAMarcus.png\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"150\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/RAM_2-150x150-1-150x150.jpeg\" width=\"150\"/></a></figure><h3><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Diploma_RudolphAMarcus.png\"><br/>2018<br/><br/>Rudolph A. Marcus</a></h3><p>Professor, PhD</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.nobelprize.org/prizes/chemistry/1992/marcus/biographical/\">Nobel Laureate: The Nobel Prize in Chemistry 1992</a></p><p><br/>Kirkwood-Noyes Professor, Professor of Chemistry</p><p>Division of Chemistry and Chemical Engineering</p><p><a href=\"https://www.cce.caltech.edu/people/rudolph-a-rudy-marcus\">California Institute of Technology</a></p><p><a href=\"http://www.cce.caltech.edu/content/rudolph-rudy-marcus\">Pasadena, CA</a></p>\n<figure><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Babes-Honorary-SCIENTIST-BP-JENA-A3-Fata-940x1329-1.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"150\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Untitled-e1513333331836-150x150-1-150x150.jpg\" width=\"150\"/></a></figure><h3><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Babes-Honorary-SCIENTIST-BP-JENA-A3-Fata-940x1329-1.jpg\"><br/>2017<br/><br/>Bhanu P. Jena</a></h3><p>Professor, PhD</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://physiology.med.wayne.edu/profile/ai6873\">Department of Physiology, School of Medicine, Wayne State University</a></p><p>Director, NanoBioScience Institute,  Detroit, MI </p>\n<figure><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Babes-Honorary-SCIENTIST-Cuadrado-A3-Fata-940x1329-1.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"150\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Cuadrado-150x150.jpg\" width=\"150\"/></a></figure><h3><a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Babes-Honorary-SCIENTIST-Cuadrado-A3-Fata-940x1329-1.jpg\"><br/>2017<br/><br/>Antonio P. Cuadrado</a></h3><p>Professor, PhD</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.bq.uam.es/acuadrado/\">Professor of Biochemistry and Molecular Biology,</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.bq.uam.es/acuadrado/\">Head of the Department of Biochemistry,</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.bq.uam.es/acuadrado/\">Faculty of Medicine, Autonomous University of Madrid (UAM),</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.bq.uam.es/acuadrado/\">Madrid, Spain,</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.ciberned.es/en/grupo-cuadrado.html\">Head of the Department of Biochemistry</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.ciberned.es/en/grupo-cuadrado.html\">Centro Investigacion Biomedica en Red Enfermedades Neurodegenerativas (CIBERNED), </a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.ciberned.es/en/grupo-cuadrado.html\">Madrid, Spain</a>,</p><p><a href=\"https://www.iib.uam.es/portal/en/investigacion/grupos\">Head of Laboratory</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.iib.uam.es/portal/investigacion/unidades/dep_fisio?p_p_id=APGIportlet_WAR_APIIBportlet_INSTANCE_2Veq&amp;p_p_lifecycle=0&amp;p_p_col_id=column-3&amp;p_p_col_count=1&amp;_APGIportlet_WAR_APIIBportlet_INSTANCE_2Veq_id=18&amp;_APGIportlet_WAR_APIIBportlet_INSTANCE_2Veq_action=list_unidad_object&amp;_APGIportlet_WAR_APIIBportlet_INSTANCE_2Veq_idUnidad=18\">Department of Pathophysiology Endocrine and Nervous System</a>,</p><p><a href=\"https://www.iib.uam.es/portal/en/investigacion/grupos\">Institute of Biomedical Investigations “Alberto Sols”,</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.iib.uam.es/portal/en/investigacion/grupos\">Madrid, Spain,</a></p>",
